// Article 5. Relocation.
#require "1-schedule.charter".
Fact noticed-move Identified by parent
Fact moved Identified by parent
Act give-move-notice Actor parent Recipient other
  Holds when True
  Creates noticed-move(parent)
Act move-home Actor parent
  Holds when Held(noticed-move(parent)) For 60
  Creates moved(parent)

Clause 5.1 Approved "3af61f853af8f2a9148a4cd57df804a6237cc360bdc9718ab109ab505d1fc4fa"
  Norm "A parent who intends to move Mia's home gives the other parent sixty days' notice. A move without that notice is a breach of this plan." => give-move-notice, move-home
.
